 LRC14: set-independent floor bound + the danger relation does not factor (klein-S8)
======================================================================================
 Gamma_0(14): phi=6, psi=24 (=index), J_2=144, |SL2(Z/14)|=14*144=2016.
 candidate set-indep constants:  1/(2 zeta2)=0.30396  phi/psi=0.25000  J2/psi^2=0.25000  1/psi=0.04167  phi/(psi)*? 

 (1) ACTUAL floor R' = m_S/(m_R m_Q) over a broad adversarial covering family (|R|+|Q|=14):
   scanned 956 valid coverings.  inf R' = 0.34394  at R=(1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6, 8, 9, 10, 11, 12, 13) (|Q|=2)
   sup |R'-1| (= sup |SPEC|/product) = 0.65606   (floor holds set-indep iff <1: YES)
   => R' bounded BELOW by 0.3439 > 0 across the family, EVEN THOUGH CV(N_R)^2 is unbounded (HYP-3554).
   compare inf R' to set-indep constants: 1/(2 zeta2)=0.30396, phi/psi=0.25, J2/psi^2=0.25.
   lowest 6 R':
